{ "include": true,  "title": "...", "description": "...", "tags": ["AI"] }
{ "include": false }   ← hides the repo from portfolio entirely
```

If the file **doesn't exist**, the repo shows up by default (opt-out model). `main.js` now fetches this file from every repo in parallel before rendering cards. Tags appear as styled chips on each card.

---

**CI/CD — where each file goes:**

| File | Goes into |
|---|---|
| `build.yml` | `.github/workflows/` of **every individual repo** |
| `portfolio-rebuild.yml` | `.github/workflows/` of **`VishnuGonuguntla.github.io`** only |

**The pipeline flow:**
```
push to any repo
  └─ lint .portfolio.json (Python validator)
  └─ detect C++ files?
       └─ yes → install Emscripten → emmake make → commit /dist
  └─ all passed?
       └─ curl dispatch → github.io repo
            └─ portfolio-rebuild.yml → deploy Pages